</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the corresponding equilibrium probability for Player <m>1</m>.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Verify that all pure strategies in equilibrium support give equal expected
payoff.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Calculate the expected payoff of two mixed strategies using</p>

<p>
<md>p^TAq.</md>
</p>
