</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Compare incentives in first-price and second-price sealed-bid auctions.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Explain why truthful bidding is weakly dominant in a standard
second-price auction.</p>
</statement>
